{"id":1781378,"retrievedAt":"2026-09-27T15:59:42.538Z","response":{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":null,"belongs_to_collection":null,"budget":0,"genres":[{"id":99,"name":"Documentary"}],"homepage":"","id":1781378,"imdb_id":null,"origin_country":["US"],"original_language":"en","original_title":"Alfonso Ossorio","overview":"Paying homage to the blazingly bizarre, boldly sincere life of Alfonso Ossorio (1916–1990), this docushort by Marianne Trench attempts a reflection on his life's work—most notably the 80-acre Long Island estate Ossorio left behind. It is an environment thoroughly extruded with pattern & motif, teeming with sculpture, topiary, bonsai, & works all but defying categorization. Across all its concomitant iterations, Ossorio's multidisciplinary stewardship of the land remains as four decades of evidence testifying to his aesthetic, ecological, & spiritual efforts. Ineffably beautiful & understandably brutal, archetypal powers unfold, revealing the fullness & emptiness of our own reflection—equal parts romantic & stark—leaving us to question how to continue or explain what has been started.","popularity":0,"poster_path":"/zmcqcuBT44uNgER3nt1JLDLxoqF.jpg","production_companies":[{"id":80186,"logo_path":null,"name":"Intercon Production","origin_country":""}],"production_countries":[{"iso_3166_1":"US","name":"United States of America"}],"release_date":"1991-06-21","revenue":0,"runtime":10,"softcore":false,"spoken_languages":[],"status":"Released","tagline":"","title":"Alfonso Ossorio","video":false,"vote_average":8,"vote_count":1,"alternative_titles":{"titles":[]},"credits":{"cast":[{"adult":false,"gender":0,"id":6507040,"known_for_department":"Acting","name":"Bellamy Bach","original_name":"Bellamy Bach","popularity":0,"profile_path":null,"cast_id":3,"character":"Narrator","credit_id":"6ab86ba6ad1d2aeae30ed325","order":0},{"adult":false,"gender":0,"id":5381349,"known_for_department":"Acting","name":"Alfonso Ossorio","original_name":"Alfonso Ossorio","popularit